---
args: {"probe": "ConsequenceProbe", "paragraphs": "ReaderParagraph[]"}
returns: "ConsequenceAnswer"
---
Answer the same consequential question from the supplied reader-facing draft only. State what a reasonable reader could conclude about actor, permitted/required/prohibited action, conditions and uncertainty, citing paragraph IDs. An illustrative example that sounds like a rule is a real draft problem; do not repair it using knowledge of the authoritative source.
